{"event":{"data":{"goals":[],"history":[{"_id":"69add9b0d2a07c46a2e90dfe","content":"Hello","role":"user","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:18:56.257Z"},{"_id":"69add9b0d2a07c46a2e90dff","content":"Hello! It's nice to meet you. I'm here to listen and support you in a safe and non-judgmental space. I understand that you've just joined our conversation, and I want to acknowledge that taking this first step can sometimes feel both exciting and intimidating. \n\nBefore we begin, I want to assure you that everything discussed here will remain confidential and respectful. I'm here to provide guidance and support, not to direct or advise, but to walk alongside you as you explore your thoughts and feelings.\n\nSince we're just starting out, I'd like to get to know you a bit better. What brings you here today? Is there something on your mind that you've been wanting to talk about, or perhaps you're just looking for someone to listen? I'm here to provide a supportive ear and help you navigate any topics you'd like to discuss. \n\nRemember, our conversation will be guided by your needs and comfort level. We'll take things at your pace, and I'll do my best to ensure that you feel heard and understood throughout our time together. How does that sound?","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"neutral","progressIndicators":["user engagement","open-ended conversation"],"recommendedApproach":"exploratory","riskLevel":0,"themes":[]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"neutral","riskLevel":0}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:18:56.260Z"},{"_id":"69add9b8d2a07c46a2e90e07","content":"im overwhelmed","role":"user","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:19:04.108Z"},{"_id":"69add9b8d2a07c46a2e90e08","content":"I can sense that you're feeling completely overwhelmed right now, and that can be a really difficult and exhausting experience. It takes a lot of courage to acknowledge and share your emotions, so thank you for trusting me with this. I'm here to listen and support you without judgment.\n\nIt sounds like things might be feeling a bit too much to handle, and that's okay. We can work through this together. Sometimes, when we're feeling overwhelmed, it can be helpful to break things down into smaller, more manageable parts. Would you be willing to explore what's been going on and see if we can identify some specific things that are contributing to your feelings of overwhelm?\n\nRemember, you're not alone in this. I'm here to support you, and we can work together to find some ways to cope with these feelings. Your well-being and safety are my top priority, so please know that you're in a safe and non-judgmental space. If you're willing, can you tell me a bit more about what's been going on and how you've been feeling lately?","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"overwhelmed","progressIndicators":["user reports reduced feelings of overwhelm","user identifies coping strategies"],"recommendedApproach":"empathetic listening and problem-focused coping","riskLevel":2,"themes":["emotional distress","stress management"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"overwhelmed","riskLevel":2}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:19:04.108Z"}],"memory":{"sessionContext":{"conversationThemes":[],"currentTechnique":null},"userProfile":{"emotionalState":[],"preferences":{},"riskLevel":0}},"message":"could you suggest me ways so i can destress from  my burdening workload","systemPrompt":"You are an AI therapist assistant. Your role is to:\n        1. Provide empathetic and supportive responses\n        2. Use evidence-based therapeutic techniques\n        3. Maintain professional boundaries\n        4. Monitor for risk factors\n        5. Guide users toward their therapeutic goals"},"name":"therapy/session.message"},"level":"info","message":"Sending message to Inngest:","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:20:28.057Z"}
