lping with your anxiety so far?","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"calm","progressIndicators":["reduced stress","improved mood"],"recommendedApproach":"continue Breathing Exercises and explore Mindfulness","riskLevel":0,"themes":["anxiety management","relaxation techniques"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"calm","riskLevel":0}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:26:21.655Z"},{"_id":"69addb7586204494c2e92c53","content":"a little","role":"user","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:26:29.729Z"},{"_id":"69addb7586204494c2e92c54","content":"It sounds like you're feeling a bit uncertain. I'm here to listen and help you explore your thoughts. Can you tell me more about what's been on your mind lately?","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"vague","progressIndicators":["user engagement","clarity of communication"],"recommendedApproach":"open-ended questioning","riskLevel":0,"themes":["unclear intentions"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"vague","riskLevel":0}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:26:29.729Z"},{"_id":"69addb8d86204494c2e92c68","content":"Theres a lot of workload and I'm worries i wont get my work done on time","role":"user","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:26:53.698Z"},{"_id":"69addb8d86204494c2e92c69","content":"I can see that you're feeling overwhelmed with your workload and worried about meeting deadlines. That can be really stressful and anxiety-provoking. Let's break it down together - what's the most pressing task that's causing you the most concern right now?","metadata":{"analysis":{"emotionalState":"Anxious","progressIndicators":["Completion of tasks on time","Reduced stress levels","Improved work-life balance"],"recommendedApproach":"Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) with a focus on task prioritization and stress management","riskLevel":2,"themes":["Workload Management","Time Management","Productivity"]},"progress":{"emotionalState":"Anxious","riskLevel":2}},"role":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-08T20:26:53.699Z"},{"_id":"69addbae86